# Venser, Fervent Forger: "Copy target instant or sorcery spell an opponent controls" - a permanent spell is not one. Bot2
# has Shock on the stack and, above it, Brazen Borrower (a flash creature spell) when Bot1 flashes in Venser and chooses
# the copy mode: the Borrower is refused as the target (CR 115.1) and the Shock is copied twice, both copies aimed at Bot2
# (2 and 2) before the Borrower resolves and the Shock hits Bot1 (2).

